id: wisun_config
label: "Wi-SUN Configurator"
package: "wisun_config"
description: >
  When initiating a new Wi-SUN project, a Wi-SUN Configurator is automatically
  included. This Configurator serves as an interface to the main settings of
  the Wi-SUN application, comprising three panels: Application, Security and
  Radio. For some examples, the Wi-SUN Configurator only displays the Radio panel.
  These examples do not have the application and security infrastructure.
category: Wi-SUN|Application
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
root_path: "wisun_config_generator/component/wisun_config"
provides:
- name: wisun_config
- name: wisun_stack_configuration
- name: wisun_phy_configuration

config_file:
#------------------------------------------------ restriction files with conditions
# LFN not support
- path: config/restrictions/lfn_not_supported.restriction
  directory: wisun
  unless:
  - "wisun_stack_lfn"
# tabs' restriction files
- path: config/restrictions/only_radio.restriction
  directory: wisun
  unless:
  - "sl_wisun_full_config"
  - "wisun_br_stack"
- path: config/restrictions/app_radio_tab.restriction
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - "wisun_br_stack"

#------------------------------------------------ default full configuration
- path: config/EU_1_1a/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4271a

# NA_1_1b
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4270a
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4270b
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4276a
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4400a
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4400b
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4400c
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4401a
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4401b
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4401c
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd2705a
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4204a
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4204b
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4204c
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4204d
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4210a
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
  condition:
  - brd4263a
- path: config/NA_1_1b/wisun_settings.wisunconf
  directory: wisun
